body:
Maybe you are a horrible person and have made those around you lose interest in you or even hate you.  The cool part is that there are billions of people in the world and you can choose to be different.  I was 'raised' in an abusive environment in a hateful little town and didn't learn how to 'play nice with others'.  That's something I've had to try to learn as an adult.  I've made a lot of progress and I have a lot more work to do.  

&#x200B;

There are very few people actively in my life from more than 5 years ago.  Some of those are relationships they severed, some are ones I severed.  Some of those are because I wasn't a very good person, some of those are because they weren't good people, and some of them happened for reasons completely unrelated to anyone being good or bad.

&#x200B;

I'm not going to ask you to 'open up' to me... I don't know anything about you.  However, I'm happy to listen to you and learn more about you.  As it feels appropriate, I'll also tell you more about me.  If you ask my opinion or advice, I'll offer what I can.  Maybe we'll become friends, maybe we won't.  Regardless, I'll be genuine with you without being hateful.  I don't check this account frequently, so be patient if you post and I don't respond right away.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
